    "body": "I think so.  This is a case where Chrome and Firefox have the same behavior, so aligning with them would likely increase compatibility.  It looks like the most compatible solution depends on \"is special\"\r\nLike I said in issue 608, we really need complete tests with each ASCII code point in each part of a URL with and without a special scheme.",
